ation reference","sourceRecordScope":"Initial lineage; not a claim that the current motion is unmodified.","authorshipScope":"Project modifications and adaptation; not a claim that every keyframe was authored from scratch."},"contractSha256":"4cb464d0f704449d189553bc5da16090ac31a12150f38824644c28696916b166"}